      <title>AMD Threadripper Halo Station 工作站支持超 1T 参数模型本地运行</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260904/AMD-Threadripper-Halo-Station-%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E7%AB%99%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E8%B6%85-1T-%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C/</link>
